WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.018
Hakkillo Bona. Haala lesdi marka, ɗum laaɓɓi ngam hollaago.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.282
1915. Haa Datomon, juulirde nden woni nder ɓernde lesdi marka.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.706
Warugo yimɓe laamiiɓe ɓe'e ɗon haa yaasi. Ammaa ko o wi'i ɗum waɗata.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.452
Njaŋge ! Masiihijo ɗon wara. Laamuuji laamiiɓe ɓaleeɓe ɗon timmina.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.466
Mawɗo diina ɗon wolwana yeeso juulirde fuu. Yimɓe ɗon nana ko o wi'i, ɓe ngaɗi tammunde.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.938
Ndeye o wari? Winen en wakkati!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.274
Caggal ɗum, ɓe mbaɗata ceede. Dowlaaji ɗii ina ɗaɓɓita jawdi ngam konu maɓɓe.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.900
Ɓiɓɓe meeɗen ngoni juuɗe amin ngam gese.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.746
Ɓe ndilli. Ɗuum woni umrooje.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.554
Gardiiɓe ɗon njahaa suka'en. Mammadu'en ɗon ngi'a haa laawol.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.712
Wakkati go'oto nder jemma, mawɓe Yahuudu'en mooɓti haa nokkuure ceniinde.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.424
Ɓe mbelti juuɗe maɓɓe dow maako, ɓe njokki alkawal.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.544
Nder nyiwre, ɓooyi konu fuɗɗi wolwugo.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.968
Ko ñalnde 17 Noofambar 1915, feccere fuɗɗii e Bona.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.082
Kolonnaaji ɗon wara. Feeje ɗon kolli pucci ɓaawo mahol bankooji.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.624
Yimɓe ɗon haɓana yimɓe ɓe'e ndilli dow mahol, kolonnaare boo ɗon cembiɗa.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.666
Goomu goomu gooduɗo wuro. Yimɓe ɗon njooɗoto bee ko'e maɓɓe.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.968
Yimɓe ummotooɓe ɓe'e ɓadake haa gure marka e bwa.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:42.690
Ammaa nder hitaande 1916, yimɓe ɓe'e ummii. Haa Bona, laana tan woni.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.688
Luttuɓe leydi ndii mbaɗi ceede masin.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.400
Baabiraaɓe meeɗen mbi'i ɓe mbaawataa.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.836
Ngam en meeɗaay yi'ugo ɗum.
